  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police cooperation Colombia, phase 2: 2018-2023 - Police cooperation Colombia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polissamarbete Colombia, fas 2: 2018-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r kapacitetsutveckling av colombiansk polis, genom den svenska Polismyndigheten.
Insatsen &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; det samarbete mellan colombiansk polis och den svenska Polismyndigheten som har p&#xe5;g&#xe5;tt sedan 2013. Projektet har utvecklats i samarbete mellan de b&#xe5;da myndigheterna och bidrar till reformen av Colombias s&#xe4;kerhetssektor, med fokus p&#xe5; &#xf6;kad medborgerlig tillit och tillg&#xe5;ng till polisens tj&#xe4;nster, samt med det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let att f&#xf6;rbereda colombiansk polis f&#xf6;r en framtida &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ng fr&#xe5;n milit&#xe4;r till civil myndighet.
Genom insatsen har svensk polis en r&#xe5;dgivande funktion till sin colombianska motsvarighet, inom omr&#xe5;dena polisutbildning, brottsf&#xf6;rebyggande arbete och j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet. Ingen vidaref&#xf6;rmedling av medel sker till colombiansk polis inom ramarna f&#xf6;r denna insats.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project support for capacity development of the Colombian police, through the Swedish Police Authority. The aim is to prepare Colombian police for a future transition from a military to civilian authority. Through the contribution, the Swedish police have an advisory function to their Colombian counterpart, in the areas of police training, crime prevention and gender equality. The project has been developed in cooperation between the two authorities and contributes to the reform of Colombia&#x2019;s security sector, focusing on increased civic trust and access to police services. The contribution is a continuation of the cooperation between the Colombian police and the Swedish Police Authority that has been ongoing since 2013, previous contribution ID-number: 52060048.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support provided by the Swedish Police Authority for capacity development of Colombian National Police. The contribution is a continuation of the cooperation between the Colombian police and the Swedish Police Authority that has been ongoing since 2013. The project has been developed by the two police authorities and contributes to the efforts to make police-services more modern, efficient and accessible to the average citizen, with the overall goal of preparing the Colombian police for a future transition from a military to civilian authority, in the context of a stable and sustainable peace. Through the contribution, the Swedish police have an advisory function to their Colombian counterpart, in the areas of police-education, crime-prevention and internal gender equality. No forwarding of funds to Colombian police takes place within the framework of this contribution.</narrative>
  </description>
